## Duplex chips

A row of joined boxes. Every `|` starts another box, so a duplex chip can have as many boxes as you like:

* `~DH-B~First|Second|Third~` Duplex input chassis (sky): ~DH-B~First|Second|Third~
* `~DH-G~First|Second|Third~` Duplex input chassis (emerald): ~DH-G~First|Second|Third~
* `~DH-O~First|Second|Third~` Duplex input chassis (orange): ~DH-O~First|Second|Third~
* `~DH-PR~First|Second|Third~` Duplex input chassis (amethyst): ~DH-PR~First|Second|Third~

